<title>UK: NTT prices $300 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>NTT prices $300 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced, joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and J.P. Morgan said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NIPPON TELEGRAPH AND TELEPHONE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    13.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.534   PAY DATE    13.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.909    SPREAD	+11 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND W/I 5-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
